WEBVTT

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:10.650
Ibuki.

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:17.740
W-What's wrong?!

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:19.990
I'm not sure! We're losing control!

00:00:25.870 --> 00:00:30.800
"Collapse"

00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:34.680
The same face as mine... The same.

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:36.590
Keita-san's Root...

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:41.470
With this, Ibuki, you'll disappear from this world.

00:00:41.890 --> 00:00:44.480
I'll... die?

00:00:44.850 --> 00:00:46.020
But...

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:48.150
No! I don't want Keita-san to die!

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:50.480
You're a Mototsumitama, right?

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:54.490
You should know that you can't go against the Doppeliner system.

00:00:56.610 --> 00:00:57.740
But...

00:00:58.030 --> 00:00:59.740
I don't want Keita-san to die!

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:03.330
Ibuki, you still have a choice.

00:01:03.950 --> 00:01:08.000
I can turn you into a Minus Root here.

00:01:08.710 --> 00:01:09.840
That's right.

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:12.050
Kill this Root.

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:19.390
No matter how much you struggle, you will have to submit to me in the end.

00:01:20.140 --> 00:01:24.140
Kill my Root and become a Minus Root?

00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:28.150
I refuse!

00:01:29.730 --> 00:01:31.730
Would you really prefer to die?

00:01:32.730 --> 00:01:36.530
You're choosing to sacrifice yourself to let your Root live?

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:42.790
In the past, you ran away in fear of your fate and yet, you are now fighting against it.

00:01:43.790 --> 00:01:48.040
However, a mere Sub cannot win against fate.

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:51.130
Keita-san!

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:53.550
I don't care if I lose.

00:01:55.050 --> 00:01:57.090
I cannot kill him.

00:01:58.340 --> 00:02:02.810
I cannot sacrifice someone else's life for my own.

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:05.560
However, I'll defeat you!

00:02:06.310 --> 00:02:08.600
I'll defeat you before I die...

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:11.310
Sawamura, I'll crush you!

00:02:11.310 --> 00:02:12.650
Keita-san!

00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:14.400
Why can't you understand?

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:17.820
I have complete control over whether you live or die.

00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:20.700
Why can't you understand that you can't defeat me?!

00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:23.330
The same goes for you. Why can't you understand?!

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:26.540
You're playing with fate.

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:27.750
No!

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:29.460
I just want to create an ideal future.

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:33.000
A world where both Roots and Subs can happily live together!

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:36.760
Then why are you making me suffer so much?!

00:02:37.670 --> 00:02:40.430
Why did you even make use of Akane-san?

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:41.840
Ibuki...

00:02:43.850 --> 00:02:45.010
Kuro.

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:47.270
Don't worry about using up my Tera.

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:48.230
Let's fight.

00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:49.350
Keita-san...

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:56.900
I'll fight... if that's your will!

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:58.860
Okay. Let's perform synchro!

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:00.110
Okay!

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:02.200
I'll definitely...

00:03:02.740 --> 00:03:04.700
I'll definitely perform synchro!

00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:26.560
Synchro!

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:37.190
Keita-san, I will no longer hesitate.

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:39.480
Kuro, that's right.

00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:41.450
Let's fight together.

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:53.830
It looks like I don't need to fight.

00:03:54.370 --> 00:03:59.090
Princess, our battle has yet to end.

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:01.300
Shinra...

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:19.480
Shinra!

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:22.990
Yakumo, it's impossible for you to do anything in your current condition.

00:04:22.990 --> 00:04:24.780
I'll be fine, Yakumo.

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:27.820
There's no way we'll lose to Shinra now.

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:35.370
Princess, I'll be glad if you are able to kill me.

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:36.580
Delete.

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:42.010
Kuro! Go!

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:44.680
Okay, Keita-san!

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:50.060
I must treasure this synchro.

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:04.150
She concentrated her Tera at a specific spot?

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:05.280
What?

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:06.660
The synchro is deep.

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:10.990
To think that she could overpower me...

00:05:11.410 --> 00:05:13.410
Kuro, finish him in one blow!

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:14.910
Okay, Keita-san!

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:33.600
Exceed, Megaexe!

00:05:45.610 --> 00:05:48.070
That was a splendid Exceed.

00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:51.030
Well done, Princess.

00:06:01.080 --> 00:06:02.380
Keita-san!

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:06.800
I'm okay. Don't cancel the synchro.

00:06:07.630 --> 00:06:09.550
That was an entertaining show.

00:06:11.090 --> 00:06:12.930
You guys are next!

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:16.390
Sorry, but we'll be the ones who win, Ibuki.

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:18.190
Raiga.

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:20.400
You can't defeat us.

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:22.270
What a dense flow of Tera.

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:24.730
Let's go, Kuro.

00:06:24.730 --> 00:06:26.400
Okay, Keita-san.

00:06:27.110 --> 00:06:28.570
It's painful, but I'll fight.

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:30.740
I must not lose!

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:47.760
It's pointless.

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:52.510
Princess...

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:57.390
Raiga, use your Exceed.

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:06.690
Exceed, Seeding Sword.

00:07:12.030 --> 00:07:13.030
Kuro!

00:07:24.840 --> 00:07:27.300
Although it was just luck, that was a good dodge.

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:32.800
This is Seeding Sword. The Exceed that I pierced Reishin with.

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:34.300
You killed my brother...

00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:36.300
However, my next shot won't miss.

00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:43.810
Do you finally understand the difference in the amount of Tera that a Master Root and a Sub can send over, Ibuki?

00:07:44.350 --> 00:07:46.190
I won't lose...

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:47.400
Kuro!

00:07:48.020 --> 00:07:48.940
Okay!

00:07:50.490 --> 00:07:52.610
Exceed!

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:56.280
Seeding Sword!

00:07:57.410 --> 00:07:58.580
Megaexe!

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:10.460
Do it now Kuro! Follow through with your attacks!

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:12.550
Okay, Keita-san!

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:17.390
Exceed, Megaexe!

00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:32.490
As expected of the Princess of the Shishigami clan.

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:35.160
Why?

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:39.620
Keita-san!

00:08:45.460 --> 00:08:49.000
The Root is gradually sucking your Tera away.

00:08:49.380 --> 00:08:52.090
He has been sucking it the moment you met.

00:08:52.090 --> 00:08:54.260
Once all the Tera has been transferred to him...

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:56.680
The Sub will die.

00:08:57.340 --> 00:09:00.760
Is that why you made us use our Exceed consecutively?

00:09:01.310 --> 00:09:03.810
That what we call tactics.

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:06.100
Ibuki, I'll ask you again.

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:08.770
Don't you wish to survive?

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:11.270
My answer will be the same no matter how many times you ask!

00:09:11.900 --> 00:09:13.190
Raiga.

00:09:16.030 --> 00:09:17.320
Kuro!

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:22.290
Keita-san!

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:25.160
Exceed!

00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:29.290
Seeding Sword!

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:31.670
This is bad, his Tera is nearly depleted.

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:33.840
Damn, what can we do?

00:09:41.050 --> 00:09:42.060
Kuro...

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:43.850
Stand...

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:47.980
The battle... hasn't ended yet...

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:54.570
Kuro... we're going to fight...

00:09:54.730 --> 00:09:57.320
Okay, Keita-san...

00:09:58.990 --> 00:10:01.120
Your contractee is out of Tera.

00:10:01.370 --> 00:10:04.330
The fight is over once you're unable to use Exceed.

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:11.290
Ibuki's Tera has ran out.

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:18.050
Keita-san!

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:21.340
Bernhard!

00:10:21.510 --> 00:10:22.850
Exceed!

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:24.890
Dreadful Storm!

00:10:35.780 --> 00:10:38.530
Exceed, Japorin!

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:54.000
Keita-san!

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:56.420
Keita-san, please don't die!

00:10:56.920 --> 00:10:59.760
Sorry, I'm out of Tera.

00:11:00.550 --> 00:11:02.140
It's your fault.

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:05.140
It's all because you formed a contract with Ibuki.

00:11:06.430 --> 00:11:08.220
Even though he's my contractee...

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:10.640
Even though I want to save him...

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:12.480
I can't do anything!

00:11:14.270 --> 00:11:15.400
Kuro...

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:18.230
Kuro, I don't regret...

00:11:19.030 --> 00:11:22.200
forming a contract with you.

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:24.780
Keita-san!

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:27.660
It's the end for me.

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:32.500
Next time, form a contract with someone who's a Root

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:35.290
and defeat them.

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:38.550
Keita-san, you're my only contractee!

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:42.050
Fight, Kuro...

00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:46.550
Keita-san...

00:11:54.400 --> 00:11:59.280
What Keita-san wished for was for me to fight to the end...

00:12:00.320 --> 00:12:02.320
That was Keita-san's will.

00:12:03.780 --> 00:12:05.820
That shall be my will too.

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:20.340
The crest...

00:12:20.340 --> 00:12:21.340
There are two of them?

00:12:25.590 --> 00:12:27.050
Impossible...

00:12:27.050 --> 00:12:28.100
Unbelievable!

00:12:32.600 --> 00:12:36.440
Tera... is reawakening inside me.

00:12:37.860 --> 00:12:41.530
What... is happening to me?

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:46.360
Keita-san!

00:12:46.360 --> 00:12:48.120
What's going on?

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:54.580
Even though he has already absorbed all of his Sub's Tera and has completely transformed into a Master Root...

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:57.080
Why is Ibuki still alive?!

00:12:58.500 --> 00:12:59.710
I see.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:01.590
Kuro, I get it.

00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:05.380
Is your Tera flowing through my body?

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:06.970
I feel it.

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:09.890
I feel our Tera cycling through us.

00:13:09.890 --> 00:13:12.390
I sense that strong, strong feeling.

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:17.900
We are now... one!

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:22.820
The Tera from Ibuki's Mototsumitama is flowing towards him, forming a cycle.

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:25.400
Is that why there are two crests?

00:13:26.320 --> 00:13:28.240
Is that possible?

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:30.620
He's alive even though his Root has absorbed all of his Tera?

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:32.040
It's a miracle.

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:34.910
Is it because they probably performed synchro using all of their feelings?

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:36.160
Raiga!

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:38.040
Kuro!

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:38.920
Okay!

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:52.010
What are you doing, Raiga?!

00:13:52.010 --> 00:13:53.180
Use your Exceed!

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:57.060
Exceed!

00:13:58.440 --> 00:14:01.190
Seeding Sword.

00:14:01.270 --> 00:14:02.070
Kuro!

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:03.270
Okay!

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:05.940
Exceed!

00:14:09.360 --> 00:14:10.870
Gigaexe!

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:24.590
Amazing...

00:14:34.260 --> 00:14:36.680
She actually shattered Seeding Sword...

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:39.730
What a powerful Exceed...

00:14:48.190 --> 00:14:51.990
I'm sorry, Kuraki-sama.

00:14:52.740 --> 00:14:54.620
I'm... done for.

00:14:55.240 --> 00:14:56.490
Raiga...

00:14:58.450 --> 00:15:05.130
Thank you... for giving me a chance to have my revenge on Reishin

00:15:06.460 --> 00:15:07.670
Raiga...

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:12.340
Why...?

00:15:13.550 --> 00:15:16.260
Why did fate betray me?!

00:15:17.680 --> 00:15:19.600
I can't believe it either,

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:22.600
the fact that I am still alive like this...

00:15:23.730 --> 00:15:26.570
I didn't want to kill you!

00:15:27.230 --> 00:15:29.780
I just wanted you to support me.

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:35.280
Sawamura, isn't that what you wanted? Someone who could affirm that what you did was correct?

00:15:35.830 --> 00:15:37.120
No.

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:40.290
I just wanted someone to manage fate together with me.

00:15:40.660 --> 00:15:42.670
Ibuki, I thought that you were the most suitable.

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:46.840
You felt that people who get close to you would die, and thus,

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:50.260
you maintain your distance with others so that they won't get involved.

00:15:51.130 --> 00:15:55.300
You are different from those who don't know how scary fate is.

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:56.550
Yet why...

00:15:57.060 --> 00:16:02.560
You have always been fighting against fate... alone.

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:05.100
But I...

00:16:06.270 --> 00:16:10.570
Even though I felt that it was okay for me to be alone,

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:13.490
there are people around me who care about me.

00:16:13.490 --> 00:16:17.830
And also, because she's fighting beside me.

00:16:19.740 --> 00:16:21.500
We can start over!

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:24.330
Ibuki, give me another chance!

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:25.920
Sawamura.

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:28.710
I'll crush fate...

00:16:29.710 --> 00:16:32.090
and the Doppeliner system!

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:51.230
Bernhard!

00:16:54.530 --> 00:16:56.160
Exceed!

00:16:56.320 --> 00:16:58.450
Dreadful Storm!

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:07.460
Bernhard!

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:08.500
June.

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:18.760
Where's Raiga?

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:20.260
We've defeated him.

00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:21.970
That's great.

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:23.770
Colonel!

00:17:24.350 --> 00:17:27.150
It seems that the helicopter Kaionji Yuki was on has crashed.

00:17:27.150 --> 00:17:28.440
What?

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:42.620
I see.

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:46.580
They found Kaionji Yuki's body in the sea.

00:17:46.580 --> 00:17:49.290
However, Sano Akane-san is still missing.

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:51.920
Why...

00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:54.170
Akane-san...

00:17:59.050 --> 00:18:02.850
Kuraki-sama, is it okay to leave things like this?

00:18:03.890 --> 00:18:08.480
Ibuki... said that he'll... change the world...

00:18:10.610 --> 00:18:14.230
Change this world controlled by fate...

00:18:16.650 --> 00:18:18.950
In the end, they are just apes.

00:18:19.660 --> 00:18:22.200
An unreliable bunch.

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:27.250
What's wrong?

00:18:50.190 --> 00:18:51.480
What's going on?

00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:55.230
Suffocating...

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:04.240
What happened?

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:11.250
That's...!

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:12.670
Impossible...

00:19:12.670 --> 00:19:13.710
What's that?

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:15.920
It's the Pure Land...

00:19:16.460 --> 00:19:18.840
The place where we, the Shishigami Clan, live.

00:19:19.300 --> 00:19:20.760
Pure Land?

00:19:27.720 --> 00:19:32.980
Why... is... the Pure Land here?

00:20:23.360 --> 00:20:23.450
This is the first frame of the ED

00:20:26.320 --> 00:20:37.420
As it thaws my frozen body, before we realize it, dawn arrives.

00:20:26.320 --> 00:20:37.420
Itsu Shika Asa wo Mukae Itetsuku Karada Tokete

00:20:37.420 --> 00:20:48.850
I've returned from my untimely death with my awakened memories.

00:20:37.420 --> 00:20:48.850
Sameta Kioku de Hayasugita Shi wo Kaeshite

00:20:49.180 --> 00:21:01.230
The sounds of the bugs weeping, the sounds of the birds dancing in flight...

00:20:49.180 --> 00:21:01.230
Mushitachi no Naku Koe mo Toritachi no Mau Haoto ni mo

00:21:01.230 --> 00:21:17.630
This soundless, white wasteland will be overflowing with their vivid colors.

00:21:01.230 --> 00:21:17.630
Oto wo Nakushita Shiroki Kare Chi ni Afureru Iro wo Sosoide Iku Azayaka ni

00:21:26.800 --> 00:21:28.970
Has the Tera reached a saturation point?

00:21:26.970 --> 00:21:31.890
"Masagami"

00:21:40.430 --> 00:21:42.230
Gross!
